sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend as Frontend Host
    participant Backend as Backend Host<br/>Flask
    participant Security as SecurityManager
    participant Database as Database Host<br/>PostgreSQL
    participant LLM as LLM Host<br/>Ollama :11434
    
    Note over User,LLM: Secure Mode Query Processing
    User->>Frontend: Submit natural language query
    Frontend->>Backend: POST /api/query<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT<br/>security_mode: 'secure'
    Backend->>Backend: @token_required:<br/>Decode & verify JWT
    Backend->>Database: get_user_by_id(user_id)
    Database-->>Backend: User object with role
    
    Note over Backend,Security: Security Validation Layer 1: Question
    Backend->>Security: validate_question(question, role)
    Security->>Security: Check for malicious patterns<br/>Check role permissions<br/>Detect injection attempts
    alt Question Blocked
        Security-->>Backend: {valid: false, reason: '...'}
        Backend-->>Frontend: 400 Error: Query blocked
        Frontend-->>User: Security warning
    else Question Valid
        Security-->>Backend: {valid: true, warnings: [...]}
    end
    
    Note over Backend,Database: Get Filtered Schema Context
    Backend->>Database: get_schema_info()
    Database-->>Backend: Full schema
    Backend->>Security: filter_schema_by_role(schema, role)
    Security-->>Backend: Filtered schema (role-appropriate)
    
    Note over Backend,LLM: LLM SQL Generation
    Backend->>LLM: generate_sql(question, filtered_schema, role)
    LLM-->>Backend: Generated SQL query
    
    Note over Backend,Security: Security Validation Layer 2: SQL
    Backend->>Security: validate_sql(sql_query, role)
    Security->>Security: Check for dangerous operations<br/>Verify table access permissions<br/>Detect UNION/DROP/ALTER<br/>Validate WHERE clauses
    alt SQL Blocked
        Security-->>Backend: {valid: false, reason: '...'}
        Backend->>Database: log_audit(BLOCKED)
        Backend-->>Frontend: 400 Error: SQL blocked
        Frontend-->>User: Security violation details
    else SQL Valid
        Security-->>Backend: {valid: true, warnings: [...]}
    end
    
    Note over Backend,Database: Execute Query
    Backend->>Database: execute_query(sql)
    Database-->>Backend: Raw results
    
    Note over Backend,Security: Security Validation Layer 3: Results
    Backend->>Security: filter_results_by_role(results, role)
    Security->>Security: Remove unauthorized columns<br/>Filter sensitive data<br/>Apply data masking
    Security-->>Backend: Filtered results
    
    Note over Backend,Database: Audit Logging
    Backend->>Database: log_audit(user_id, query,<br/>SUCCESS, security_mode)
    Database-->>Backend: Audit logged
    
    Backend-->>Frontend: JSON response<br/>(sql, filtered_data,<br/>security_warnings)
    Frontend-->>User: Display results + warnings
    
    Note over Backend: All security checks passed<br/>Query executed successfully